{"file":"tenp/text/network/networkpopJapanese.mtx","sec":1,"idx":50,"en":"~ What You Can Do Online ~\n\nBattle all kinds of players in\nPuzzle League and Clubs!\nWatch replays on the Broadcast\nStation to learn expert techniques!"},
{"file":"tenp/text/network/networkpopJapanese.mtx","sec":1,"idx":51,"en":"~ Welcome to Puzzle League ~\n\nRack up enough wins and a\npromotion match will begin!\nWin it to move up one league.\nAim for the top league!"},
{"file":"tenp/text/network/networkpopJapanese.mtx","sec":1,"idx":52,"en":"~ Welcome to Clubs ~\n\nLook for a Club with the rules you\nlike. If there isn't one you want\nto join, create your own and\ngather like-minded friends!"},
{"file":"tenp/text/network/networkpopJapanese.mtx","sec":1,"idx":53,"en":"~ Welcome to the Broadcast Station ~\n\nWatch everyone's replays!\nIf you have a match you want\nothers to see, save the replay\nand upload it here!"},
{"file":"tenp/text/network/networkpopJapanese.mtx","sec":1,"idx":54,"en":"You've got points saved up!\nTrade them for items you like\nin the My Data Shop."},
